# doq: translated after #1094 review 2026-11-21
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum machine learning {#quantum-machine-learning}"
msgstr "Pembelajaran mesin kuantum {#quantum-machine-learning}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quantum machine learning (QML) is an emerging field that combines quantum computing and machine learning to explore new ways of analyzing data, \n"
"recognizing patterns, and solving complex computational problems. It applies concepts from quantum mechanics to develop quantum algorithms and machine\n"
"learning models that can run on quantum computers or integrate quantum and classical computing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Quantum machine learning (QML) adalah bidang yang sedang berkembang yang menggabungkan komputasi kuantum dan machine learning untuk menjelajahi cara-cara baru dalam menganalisis data, \n"
"mengenali pola, dan memecahkan masalah komputasi yang kompleks. QML menerapkan konsep mekanika kuantum untuk mengembangkan algoritma kuantum dan model machine\n"
"learning yang bisa berjalan di komputer kuantum atau mengintegrasikan komputasi kuantum dan klasik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Research in QML includes quantum neural networks, quantum kernel methods, and hybrid quantum-classical algorithms, which use classical computers to \n"
"optimize models while quantum processors perform specific computations. Although QML might offer advantages for certain tasks, practical benefits over \n"
"classical machine learning remain an active area of research.\n"
msgstr ""
"Riset di QML mencakup quantum neural network, metode quantum kernel, dan algoritma hybrid kuantum-klasik, yang memakai komputer klasik untuk \n"
"mengoptimalkan model sementara prosesor kuantum melakukan komputasi tertentu. Meskipun QML mungkin menawarkan keunggulan untuk tugas-tugas tertentu, manfaat praktisnya dibandingkan \n"
"machine learning klasik masih menjadi area riset yang aktif.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A common workflow trains a model mostly on classical hardware, and then uses a quantum processor for a targeted subroutine, such as optimizing the diversity of an ensemble of learners or evaluating a quantum kernel, where quantum effects might provide an advantage over a purely classical approach. With this hybrid structure, you can apply quantum resources to the part of the problem where they can have the most effect, while keeping most of a machine learning pipeline, such as data preprocessing and large-scale training, on classical infrastructure. The application functions on this page follow this pattern: one for classification tasks, and one for feature extraction.\n"
msgstr "Alur kerja yang umum melatih model sebagian besar di hardware klasik, lalu memakai prosesor kuantum untuk subrutin yang terarah, seperti mengoptimalkan keragaman ensemble learner atau mengevaluasi quantum kernel, di mana efek kuantum mungkin memberi keunggulan dibandingkan pendekatan klasik murni. Dengan struktur hybrid ini, kamu bisa memakai sumber daya kuantum di bagian masalah yang paling bisa terpengaruh, sambil menjaga sebagian besar pipeline machine learning, seperti preprocessing data dan pelatihan skala besar, tetap di infrastruktur klasik. Application functions di halaman ini mengikuti pola tersebut: satu untuk tugas klasifikasi, dan satu untuk ekstraksi fitur.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"application-functions\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Application functions for quantum machine learning {#application-functions-for-quantum-machine-learning}"
msgstr "Application functions untuk quantum machine learning {#application-functions-for-quantum-machine-learning}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following quantum functions apply this hybrid approach to machine learning tasks, and use quantum hardware at different points of a pipeline:\n"
msgstr "Fungsi kuantum berikut menerapkan pendekatan hybrid ini ke tugas machine learning, dan memakai hardware kuantum di titik-titik berbeda dalam sebuah pipeline:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Singularity Machine Learning - Classification** solves binary classification problems. You provide your own training data, and the function classically trains an ensemble of learners, then uses a quantum algorithm to optimize that ensemble for diversity and generalization, before returning predictions on new data.\n"
msgstr "**Singularity Machine Learning - Classification** memecahkan masalah klasifikasi biner. Kamu menyediakan data pelatihanmu sendiri, dan fungsi ini melatih ensemble learner secara klasik, lalu memakai algoritma kuantum untuk mengoptimalkan ensemble itu demi keragaman dan generalisasi, sebelum mengembalikan prediksi pada data baru.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Rimay Quantum Feature Extraction** adds a preprocessing step to an existing machine learning pipeline. You provide classical tabular data, and the function returns quantum-transformed features generated on quantum hardware. You can use these features on their own, or combine them with your original features, to train a classical model of your choice.\n"
msgstr "**Rimay Quantum Feature Extraction** menambahkan langkah preprocessing ke pipeline machine learning yang sudah ada. Kamu menyediakan data tabular klasik, dan fungsi ini mengembalikan fitur hasil transformasi kuantum yang dihasilkan di hardware kuantum. Kamu bisa memakai fitur ini sendiri, atau menggabungkannya dengan fitur aslimu, untuk melatih model klasik pilihanmu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"IBM Quantum&reg; Functions are a beta feature available only to IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan, and On-Prem (through the IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users. Refer to [Set up IBM Quantum Functions](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) for instructions on getting access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Catatan\">\n"
"IBM Quantum&reg; Functions adalah fitur beta yang hanya tersedia untuk pengguna IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan, dan On-Prem (melalui IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan. Lihat [Set up IBM Quantum Functions](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) untuk petunjuk cara mendapatkan akses.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

